# Checksummed bytes: the seed files and the measurement reports they cite
# are hashed (seed/demo/manifest.json, seed/coverage.json), so line-ending
# conversion (core.autocrlf) must never touch them (Story 1.3b; AD-16).
seed/** -text
analysis/output/** -text
test/fixtures/seed/** -text

# Step 1 runs in a Linux container: its files stay LF on every host, so no
# script, config or fixture reaches the container with a carriage return
# (Story 2.1a, spike error 2). PDFs are binary; that line comes after
# this one, so it wins for a PDF under ingest/.
ingest/** text eol=lf
*.pdf binary
